Subject: Read complete interleaved resources and report missing piece termination

Changes to LGPL-2.1-or-later libgxps 0.3.2, 2026-10-28.
Preserve the public API/ABI and existing piece reader, without package rewriting.
Original synthetic multipart fonts/images expose first-piece-only resource reads.
Single [0].last.piece parts were not opened; missing pieces could recurse at EOF.
This is not exhaustive OPC validation (e.g. duplicate/ambiguous unused parts).

